@startuml
title What happens as the month's spending rises
start
:Spending of the month, actual and forecast;
if (50 % of the budget reached?) then (yes)
  :E-mail to the owner;
else (no)
endif
if (90 % reached, or the forecast\nexceeds the budget?) then (yes)
  :E-mail to the owner and to the team;
  :Automatic: test and integration\nare scaled to nothing;
else (no)
endif
if (100 % reached?) then (yes)
  :Alert by every channel;
  :The owner decides;
  fork
    :Level 2\nproduction scaled to nothing:\nthe store is closed,\nnothing is lost;
  fork again
    :Level 3\nthe database instance is stopped:\ndata kept, only storage is billed;
  fork again
    :Level 4\nbilling is detached from the project:\neverything stops,\nresources may be lost;
  end fork
else (no)
endif
stop
@enduml
